# Product Requirement Document: Adaptive AI Text-Interview System

## Objective

Extend the existing Streamlit ATS portal with a lightweight, secure, 5-question text-based adaptive interview module. Built on top of the current Python + Ollama (`llama3.1`) stack, this module evaluates shortlisted candidates dynamically using research-backed frameworks (STAR methodology, Guardrail Prompts) within a 2–3 hour implementation window.

---

## 1. System Architecture & Workflows

| Component | Tech / File Target | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Auth & Routing** | `app.py` | Authenticates candidate via Email & Password; retrieves candidate state from `data/results/*.json`. |
| **Interview Engine** | `modules/interviewer.py` | Manages stateful turn-by-turn question generation (Max 5 turns) using the **STAR framework**. |
| **Hybrid Guardrail** | `modules/guardrails.py` | Tier-1 Regex & Prompt constraints + Tier-2 secondary Ollama evaluation for injection/vagueness. |
| **Scoring Engine** | `modules/evaluator.py` | Evaluates completed transcripts against 5 core criteria and updates storage. |

