## 4. Implementation Steps (2-3 Hour Roadmap)

1. **`modules/guardrails.py` (30 mins):** Create regex rules and basic moderation sub-routine.
2. **`modules/interviewer.py` (40 mins):** Write prompt template appending previous Q&A turns to context for adaptive generation.
3. **`app.py` UI Integration (45 mins):** Add Streamlit `st.session_state` keys (`current_q_index`, `transcript`, `authenticated`) and simple text-area form submit.
4. **`modules/evaluator.py` (25 mins):** Re-use resume evaluator JSON prompt structure for interview transcript scoring.